<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-SFE January wheat drifts A$0.50 a tonne.</title>
<headline>RTRS-SFE January wheat drifts A$0.50 a tonne.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nearby January wheat drifted slightly lower in light trading at the Sydney Futures Exchange on Friday.</p>
<p>The January contract saw volume of five lots traded. No other contracts were traded.</p>
<p>Traders said January came under modest perssure in response lower prices recorded overnight in CBOT trading.</p>
<p>The market showed little reaction to confirmation on Friday that Australia would sell Iraq 250,000 tonnes of wheat as part of the United Nation's food-for-oil agreement.  </p>
